@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+## Why
+
+The app should show how old a task is and what changed recently, so each task must record when it was created and when it was last changed.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Every `Task` gains `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings.
+- On add the two are equal; completing, reopening, renaming, tagging or untagging sets `updatedAt` to the time of the change.
+- The domain may not read the clock, so the list takes a clock (a function returning a `Date`) as a parameter; `createTodoList` accepts an optional clock, defaulting to the system clock.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `task-timestamps`: creation and last-change times on tasks.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+`src/domain/task.ts`, `src/domain/list.ts`, `src/index.ts`, and the tests. No new dependency.
